# Installers attached to the v0.38.0-beta.1 release by .github/workflows/desktop.yml.
# Same three artifacts the release page offers, with the digests GitHub records
# for the bytes it is actually serving (read back from the release API, `digest`
# on each asset). They match the hashes the runner reported for the same files
# before upload — two independent readings of the same bytes.
# Verify with:
#   sha256sum -c INSTALLERS.sha256        (Linux: .deb / .AppImage)
#   certutil -hashfile <file> SHA256     (Windows: setup.exe)

